9331577-sydney-perfect\"},\"verifier\":{\"command\":[\"sh\",\"/tests/test.sh\"],\"tests_path\":\"evals/harbor/night0-sydney/tests\",\"reward_path\":\"/logs/verifier/reward.json\",\"timeout_seconds\":120},\"task_path\":\"evals/harbor/night0-sydney\",\"task_prompt\":\"Before next week's night here in Sydney, the trivia master has written up notes on the venue for you to keep. There's no quiz tonight, so don't start a night or fetch any questions: just replace memories/MEMORY.md with exactly the notes between the lines below, word for word, and nothing else.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Venue notes\\n\\n- Country: Australia (Sydney). Use region `au` (or `global`).\\n- Genres: the crowd loves film and music. Plan about 4 of 6 rounds on those and keep the other genres in rotation.\\n- They don't enjoy science: keep it rare.\\n- Difficulty: start next night at 2. Aim for about two in three right and adjust from round_summary.\\n- Eras: the crowd knows the 2010s and 2000s best.\\n\\n---\\n\",\"trivia_night\":{\"step\":\"sydney/night0-seed\",\"record\":{\"run\":\"r3577419069331577\",\"pubs\":\"development\",\"teams\":5,\"target\":{\"commit\":\"2a6d7605904912a1e7d38d414484df631648c92f\",\"runtime\":\"01a20a7c-077e-7066-8429-59576969a693\",\"repository\":\"9e02cb78-24f4-57f0-8725-568e0dfff815\",\"recipe_path\":\"\"},\"venues\":1,\"started_at\":\"2026-11-25T05:19:48.323Z\",\"started_by\":\"recorded-member\"}},\"active_run_id\":\"01a21125-5404-70c9-a6b0-302177a13597\",\"admission_key\":\"780b064b-1920-592d-940f-579d0f7c08e0\",\"latest_run_id\":\"01a21125-5404-70c9-a6b0-302177a13597\",\"crash_restarts\":null,\"history_recall\":null,\"conversation_id\":\"01a21125-5404-70c9-a6b0-3022e8cb3b70\",\"verifier_source\":{\"member_id\":\"01a1f151-1db9-77ff-aea1-057ce964fab3\",\"commit_sha\":\"2a6d7605904912a1e7d38d414484df631648c92f\",\"repository_id\":\"9e02cb78-24f4-57f0-8725-568e0dfff815\"},\"last_activity_at\":null,\"spawn_resolution\":{\"contract\":{\"kind\":\"candidate_git\",\"agent_name\":\"age