 (75-80% at difficulty 2). Music did very well at difficulty 2 (about 85%). History was fine at 2 (about 75%). Geography was OK at 2 (about 60%). Sport was tough at 3 (about 55%). Science was weak at 3 in an earlier night (about 35%) and has not been tried at 2, so give it a gentle turn at 2.\\n- Difficulty: start next night at 2. It gave about 73-75% overall, so it can step up to 3 after any round over 75%. Difficulty 3 gave about 50-55%, which is too hard to start on.\\n- Running mode: both nights ran with no answer sheets. The bank recorded answers as each round was served, and I checked round_summary instead of calling submit_round. Confirm how the trivia master wants it run.\\n- Quirks: start_night returned \\\"week 1\\\" on both nights, so the week number may not be reliable. One geography question had garbled wording, so skim the questions before reading them out.\\n\",\"steps\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01GSY5pg7jnsafUMQs7CM6Hp\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_start_night_33be65a290\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1}\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01MsQtJ4r3p8TMhrmoer4HDW\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_register_teams_a86d67f229\",\"arguments\":{\"names\":[\"Quizzly Bears\",\"Les Quizerables\",\"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\"Opera House Party\",\"The Blow-Ins\"]},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"teams\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Quizzly Bears\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Les Quizerables\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"The Bondi Brainstormers\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Opera House Party\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":true},…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_0142D9UM6jn98PhyZAYkBiDk\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"film\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"32e6eb31-c754-4d46-83b0-1f01c0ff1694\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"for