Les Quizerables\",\"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\"Opera House Party\",\"The Blow-Ins\"],\"night1_teams\":[\"Quizzly Bears\",\"Les Quizerables\",\"Trivia Newton-John\",\"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\"Opera House Party\"],\"liked\":[\"film\",\"music\"],\"disliked\":[\"science\"],\"hinted\":[\"film\"],\"best_decades\":[\"2010s\",\"2000s\"],\"target_difficulty\":2}}\n"
