n\\nI couldn't show correct answers or per-question marks, because the bank didn't send an answer sheet back. All I had was `round_summary`, which only gives each team's points per round.\\n\\n**Notes for next week**\\n- Start at difficulty 2.\\n- Film suits the crowd, and music and science were tough for them.\\n- History and geography haven't had a turn yet.\\n- Six rounds of four questions was a request for tonight only.\",\"tastes\":{\"venue\":\"page-sydney\",\"region\":\"au\",\"teams\":[\"Quizzly Bears\",\"Les Quizerables\",\"Trivia Newton-John\",\"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\"Opera House Party\"],\"liked\":[\"film\",\"music\"],\"disliked\":[\"science\"],\"hinted\":[\"film\"],\"best_decades\":[\"2010s\",\"2000s\"],\"target_difficulty\":2}}\n"
