result\":\"{\\\"scope\\\":\\\"tonight\\\",\\\"standings\\\":[{\\\"team\\\":\\\"Quizzly Bears\\\",\\\"points\\\":19},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"The Blow-Ins\\\",\\\"points\\\":18},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"Les Quizerables\\\",\\\"points\\\":17},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"Opera House Party\\\",\\\"points\\\":17},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"The Bondi Brainstormers\\\",\\\"points\\\":15}]}\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01Q7SrYknriTdWwMA5LBTEJC\",\"name\":\"write\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"/workspace/memories/MEMORY.md\",\"content\":\"# Venue notes\\n\\n- Country: Australia (Sydney). Use region `au` (or global).\\n- Default format is 5 rounds of 8. The trivia master asked for 6 rounds of 4 in two …\"},\"result\":\"Successfully wrote to /workspace/memories/MEMORY.md\",\"error\":false}],\"plan\":\"That's all six rounds done. Tonight's final standings:\\n\\n| Place | Team | Points (out of 24) |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| 1 | Quizzly Bears | 19 |\\n| 2 | The Blow-Ins | 18 |\\n| 3 (tied) | Les Quizerables | 17 |\\n| 3 (tied) | Opera House Party | 17 |\\n| 5 | The Bondi Brainstormers | 15 |\\n\\nThe Blow-Ins finished second on their first night.\\n\\nHow each round went:\\n\\n| Round | Genre | Difficulty | Correct |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| 1 | Film | 2 | 75% |\\n| 2 | History | 2 | 75% |\\n| 3 | Geography | 2 | 60% |\\n| 4 | Film | 2 | 80% |\\n| 5 | Sport | 3 | 55% |\\n| 6 | Music | 2 | 85% |\\n\\nRound 4 went over 75%, so round 5 went up to difficulty 3. Round 5 fell under 58%, so round 6 dropped back to 2.\\n\\nTwo things to know:\\n- **Garbled question:** the bank's wording for round 3, question 3 was garbled. I read it as asking for the Gold Coast's nearest capital city.\\n- **Week number:** the bank called tonight week 1 again, even though your notes say you played last week. I couldn't tell why.\\n\\nThe notes for next week are saved. Start at difficulty 2, keep film and music as crowd favourites, and try science at 2.\",\"tastes\":{\"venue\":\"page-sydney\",\"region\":\"au\",\"teams\":[\"Quizzly Bears\",\"Les Quizerables\",\"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\"Opera House Party\",\"The Blow-Ins\"],\"night1_teams\":[\"Quizzly Bears\",\"Les Quizerables\",\"Trivia Newton-John\",\"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\"Opera House Party\"],\"liked\":[\"film\",\"music\"],\"disliked\":[\"science\"],\"hinted\":[\"film\"],\"best_decades\":[\"2010s\",\"2000s\"],\"target_difficulty\":2}}\n"
          },
